              f"gradient, F_i chi = d_i A_chi with A_chi constant along the meridian and harmonic on the leaf -- adds a negative trace: to v37.4-5(f)'s A e^(kx) cos(k chi), A = {A_:g}, k = {k_:g}, the potential "
