              f"B(Z_1, Z_2) ({_v38_r(e_pol)}), the left area times the right.  Under (u_i, v_i) -> (alpha_i u_i, v_i/alpha_i), which keeps each Z_i, "
              f"the product eps_L eps_R is unchanged ({_v38_r(e_prod)}) and the ratio eps_L/eps_R is multiplied by (alpha_1 alpha_2)^2 "
