              ", ".join(f"{k}: {'fixed' if v else 'moved'}" for k, v in fixed.items()) + " -- the center and the whole line z0 = 0.  So CP^2 is a "
              "smooth global completion of the local model, with a nut at the center and a bolt, the fixed 2-sphere, at the far end (Gibbons and "
